msgid "Kasasa"
msgstr "Kasasa"

msgid "Snip and pin useful information"
msgstr "截取并贴置有用的信息"

msgid "screenshot;clipping;snip;image;pin;reference;screencast;"
msgstr "截图;剪裁;片段;图像;贴图;参考;录屏;"

msgid "Pin a screencast"
msgstr "贴置实时录屏"

msgid ""
"Clip what's important to a small floating window, so you don't have to "
"switch between windows or workspaces repeatedly. The window can become "
"miniaturized or have its opacity reduced, in order to do not block what's "
"behind it."
msgstr ""
"将重要内容截取到一个小型悬浮窗口中，免去反复切换窗口或工作区。窗口可以缩小"
"或降低不透明度，以免遮挡其后方的内容。"

msgid "Best used with:"
msgstr "建议搭配以下功能使用："

msgid "\"Always on Top\" and/or \"Always on Visible Workspace\""
msgstr "“置于顶层”和/或“始终位于可见工作区”"

msgid "A keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

msgid ""
"On GNOME, go to Settings → Keyboard → View and Customize Shortcuts → Custom "
"Shortcuts. There you can set a shortcut to run <code>flatpak run "
"io.github.kelvinnovais.Kasasa</code> "
msgstr ""
"在 GNOME 中，打开“设置 → 键盘 → 查看及自定义快捷键 → 自定义快捷键”，然后"
"可以设置快捷键来运行 <code>flatpak run io.github.kelvinnovais.Kasasa</code>。"

msgid ""
"Note: On GNOME versions < 46, a dialog will appear to set up and take the "
"screenshot, instead of directly using the GNOME's screenshoter; this may be "
"inconvenient."
msgstr ""
"注意：在低于 46 的 GNOME 版本中，会显示一个用于配置和截取屏幕的对话框，"
"而不会直接使用 GNOME 截图工具；这可能不太方便。"

msgid "Main window"
msgstr "主窗口"

msgid "Kasasa can become a window miniature"
msgstr "Kasasa 可以缩小为窗口缩略图"

msgid "Or decrease its opacity"
msgstr "也可以降低窗口不透明度"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

msgid "Language used by Kasasa after the next restart"
msgstr "Kasasa 下次重启后使用的语言"

msgctxt "shortcut window"
